  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "時到，花就開"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>郭伊貞</b></span></p><div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">人講「做雞tio̍h tshíng，做人tio̍h píng。」意思是m̄管是雞iah是人，lóng ài認真骨力拍拚，tsiah有出頭天ê一工。Iáu-m̄-koh是m̄是mā有「ē開花，bē結子」ê時tsūn--neh？比論講，早起時仔ê山bông，kā無聊ê青春罩--leh，未來ê ǹg望像日頭ê光線有ná無，看山m̄是山，kám講「無日m̄知晝，無鬚m̄知老」，是我就án-ne pha荒去--ah？Tse kám是我失覺察，iah是佗位tîng-tânn--去，一直到beh暗仔ê涼風kā我搧hōo清醒，流浪ê跤跡行一條khah無人ê路，khuann-khuann仔是、gōng-gōng仔行，因為時到，花就開。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit遍阿母講伊beh家己來，伊牽阮做伙就是買mi̍h件、se̍h市場，伊講現實leh做人，lán人tio̍h看款，拚勢ê人m̄-nā為生活，iáu-koh有努力ê意義。人生tsit條糊塗siàu，有偌濟算bē清mā還bē了，lán bat kā人欠siàu行到tann，mā有討bē tńg--來ê人情。等tńg--去ê時，siáng是siáng ê債主，siáng m̄是揹規身軀ê江湖kap義氣，至少lín阿爸就是。所致，揣無路就家己舖一條路，揣無厝就家己疊磚仔khōng，時到時擔當，橫直每一步lóng準算，阿母就án-ne安慰lué志失神ê我。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">考試逐年有，逐年無我ê名，講驚見笑，無講鬱心內，面仔憂憂，阿母早就kā我看出出，別人ê囝一kái就考tiâu，m̄是老師，無，就公務人員，自細漢聽到tann，kap親tsiânn bē比phīng，我哪ē tsiah-nī無才調、無出脫……。有一段時間，暗時仔lóng睏bē好勢，tiānn-tiānn leh陷眠，身體mā開始koh-iūnn，夢見阿母suān削ê眼神，厝邊頭尾phì-siùnn兼khau洗，惡夢親像蜈蜞咬蛤m̄願煞，hit款日子是按怎度--過--ê已經無法度稽考--ah。阿母專工來揣--我，ài我心情放輕鬆，伊有替我拜神求文昌，考試有時mā tio̍h看運氣，今年考無，明年tsiah-koh來，代誌ná行ná看，鐵樹mā ē開花，siáng無目屎吞腹肚ê凝心。阿母用伊ê溫柔kap體貼，kā一粒nah--落-去ê心khioh--tńg-來，熨hōo平平，bē koh跋倒。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">本底tàm-suê ê意志開始做奇妙ê夢，人生ê膽hiannh在人按怎看待，beh投降iah是心肝掠坦橫，愈歹做ê穡頭，愈硬táu ê khang-khuè，敢m̄是tī船頂tsiah看有ê風景，浮沉mā有時，thìng候時到，花就開。&nbsp;</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span><!--more--></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi5k1EaL5HjtbWYzLNg0MgYsU7X4uphWkBrTN-LJ2LYvePGdhBSJrpS1E4VjWm5OKLYKSpfiSBwJeZvaVp1o53K_AI8J95cClKYw90gr-kdZNqqfG3NKii4znjNEIPraNV7YlFpavfEetSY0k03uqOSkN2dmpcQH1JF9Z2oDy17ad6nn0HE9nuW7ghZtA/s1424/348%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi5k1EaL5HjtbWYzLNg0MgYsU7X4uphWkBrTN-LJ2LYvePGdhBSJrpS1E4VjWm5OKLYKSpfiSBwJeZvaVp1o53K_AI8J95cClKYw90gr-kdZNqqfG3NKii4znjNEIPraNV7YlFpavfEetSY0k03uqOSkN2dmpcQH1JF9Z2oDy17ad6nn0HE9nuW7ghZtA/w450-h640/348%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhcs8RPBU7To4Qs2SOACIKTvTox4kFdn4d3V2zq6v_6XVbOru_gsgz5VW-rCcdIYvpTGDF3wIZGOb6AP--i_g837t46T49vlYacSWiKRaL4ptz1JYel2LDhMbKDKcRSBajCogUzVl22au8osnn5_zlYC65kA7Zmtk6hBav9Ca8-w50bWyJauLCBcmwhGA/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1348%E6%9C%9F18.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhcs8RPBU7To4Qs2SOACIKTvTox4kFdn4d3V2zq6v_6XVbOru_gsgz5VW-rCcdIYvpTGDF3wIZGOb6AP--i_g837t46T49vlYacSWiKRaL4ptz1JYel2LDhMbKDKcRSBajCogUzVl22au8osnn5_zlYC65kA7Zmtk6hBav9Ca8-w50bWyJauLCBcmwhGA/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1348%E6%9C%9F18.jpg\" width=\"454